+# Central Package Management conversion
+
+## Outcome
+Contoso.Json changed from 8.0.0 to 10.0.0 in Worker and Fabrikam.Identity changed
+from 1.0.0 to 1.2.0 in Shared. These version changes carry compatibility risk.
+
+Restore, build, and application execution passed after conversion. Baseline and
+after-conversion binlogs and package snapshots were retained for review.
